<title>USA: TENNIS-NOVOTNA BEATS GRAF IN ADVANTA FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOVOTNA BEATS GRAF IN ADVANTA FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the Advanta Championship women's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 1-Steffi Graf (Germany) 6-4, retired.</p>
</text>
